      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/31-crayfishes-shrimps-crabs-snails-mussels/euryrhynchus_amazoniensis_en/",
      "html": "<p>A rare shrimp species from South America. The delightful pattern of points and stripes on their body justifies its English name Peru Zebra Shrimp. It reaches only about 3 cm.</p><p>April 2006: available again.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "distribution",
